From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:09:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add GitHub Pages deployment and manual boss/grace
 toggles

- Add .github/workflows/deploy.yml: builds with GITHUB_PAGES=true and
  deploys .output/public/ to GitHub Pages via Actions; copies index.html
  to 404.html for SPA client-side routing fallback.

- vite.config.ts: set base='/elden-ring-compass/' and Nitro static preset
  when GITHUB_PAGES env is set; enable TanStack Start prerendering for the
  root route only so GitHub Pages gets a real index.html.

- router.tsx: pass basepath=import.meta.env.BASE_URL to createRouter so
  TanStack Router respects the /elden-ring-compass/ prefix on GitHub Pages.

- save-file-source-store.ts: prefix SAMPLE_SAVE_URL with BASE_URL so the
  sample save resolves correctly under the GitHub Pages subdirectory.

- Add manual-overrides-store.ts: Effect Atom backed by localStorage that
  stores per-entity manual done/not-done toggles (keyed by event-flag id).

- bosses-data-table.tsx: add a 'Manual' checkbox column that lets users
  mark any boss as defeated without connecting a save file. State persists
  across page refreshes via the new manual-overrides store.

- graces-data-table.tsx: same Manual checkbox column for Sites of Grace.

